{
  "id": "a2-08",
  "stage": 13,
  "title": "En: the biggest, the best + as … as + coğrafya",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "En …: the + -est / the most",
      "body": "<table><tr><th>Sıfat</th><th>Daha</th><th>En</th></tr><tr><td>big</td><td>bigger</td><td><b>the biggest</b></td></tr><tr><td>easy</td><td>easier</td><td><b>the easiest</b></td></tr><tr><td>expensive</td><td>more expensive</td><td><b>the most expensive</b></td></tr><tr><td>good</td><td>better</td><td><b>the best</b> «best»</td></tr><tr><td>bad</td><td>worse</td><td><b>the worst</b> «{w}ööst»</td></tr></table><p class=\"ex\">It's <b>the biggest</b> city <b>in</b> Turkey. → Türkiye'nin en büyük şehri.<br>She's <b>the best</b> teacher <b>in</b> the school. → Okuldaki en iyi öğretmen.<br>It's <b>the most beautiful</b> place <b>in</b> the world. → Dünyadaki en güzel yer.</p><p>“En”den önce <b>the</b> unutulmaz. Yer için <b>in</b> kullanılır: in the world, in London, in my family.</p>"
    },
    {
      "heading": "“En” yazım kuralları",
      "body": "<p>“Daha” kurallarının aynısı; -er yerine <b>-est</b>, more yerine <b>the most</b>:</p><table><tr><th>Sıfat</th><th>Kural</th><th>Örnek</th></tr><tr><td>Tek heceli</td><td>the + est</td><td>old → the old<b>est</b>, tall → the tall<b>est</b></td></tr><tr><td>-e ile biten</td><td>the + st</td><td>nice → the nice<b>st</b>, safe → the safe<b>st</b></td></tr><tr><td>Kısa: ünsüz + ünlü + ünsüz</td><td>son harf ikilenir</td><td>big → the bi<b>gg</b>est, hot → the ho<b>tt</b>est</td></tr><tr><td>-y ile biten</td><td>y → iest</td><td>easy → the eas<b>iest</b>, happy → the happ<b>iest</b></td></tr><tr><td>İki heceli (çoğu) ve uzun</td><td>the most</td><td>the <b>most</b> famous, the <b>most</b> expensive</td></tr><tr><td>Düzensiz</td><td></td><td>good → the <b>best</b>, bad → the <b>worst</b>, far → the <b>furthest</b>, little → the <b>least</b></td></tr></table><p><b>the least</b> «liist» = en az: the least expensive (en ucuz, en az pahalı).</p><p><b>one of the …</b> + çoğul isim = en …lerden biri: She's <b>one of the best</b> teachers. → En iyi öğretmenlerden biri.</p>"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Eşitlik: as … as",
      "body": "<p class=\"ex\">Tom is <b>as tall as</b> his father. → Tom babası kadar uzun.<br>My car isn't <b>as fast as</b> yours. → Arabam seninki kadar hızlı değil.<br>It's <b>not as expensive as</b> I thought. → Düşündüğüm kadar pahalı değil.</p><p>as … as arasında sıfat <b>yalın</b> kalır: <span class=\"bad\">✘ as taller as</span>.</p>"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Coğrafya",
      "body": "<table><tr><th>İngilizce</th><th>Okunuş</th><th>Türkçe</th></tr><tr><td>mountain</td><td>«[maun]-tın»</td><td>dağ</td></tr><tr><td>river</td><td>«[ri]-vı»</td><td>nehir</td></tr><tr><td>sea</td><td>«sii»</td><td>deniz</td></tr><tr><td>lake</td><td>«leyk»</td><td>göl</td></tr><tr><td>island</td><td>«[ay]-lınd»</td><td>ada (s okunmaz!)</td></tr><tr><td>forest</td><td>«[fo]-rist»</td><td>orman</td></tr><tr><td>village / town</td><td>«[vi]-lic» / «taun»</td><td>köy / kasaba</td></tr><tr><td>building</td><td>«[bil]-ding»</td><td>bina</td></tr><tr><td>place</td><td>«pleys»</td><td>yer, mekân</td></tr><tr><td>north / south</td><td>«noo{t}» / «sau{t}»</td><td>kuzey / güney</td></tr><tr><td>east / west</td><td>«iist» / «{w}est»</td><td>doğu / batı</td></tr></table><p class=\"ex\">The Thames is the longest river in England. → Thames İngiltere'nin en uzun nehridir.<br>Ben Nevis is the highest mountain in Britain. → Ben Nevis Britanya'nın en yüksek dağıdır.</p><p><b>high</b> «hay» = yüksek (dağ); <b>tall</b> = uzun (bina, insan).</p>"
    }
  ],
